\ Two records with the same layout are different types. The kernel would take
\ a Pair where a Stock is wanted, since both are two Ints; the checker refuses
\ it by name (`dec.typed-records-and-variants`).
record Stock { on-hand:Int reserved:Int }
record Pair { a:Int b:Int }

: reserved
  (forall ρ; ρ p:Pair -- ρ n:Int)
  Stock.reserved ;

: record-mismatch ( -- ) ;
